        <p>PROM ONE of the ABOVE ADDRESSES. Remarkably handsome Solid Walnut Bedroom Suite, consisting of full fift. wardrobe with two robing bevelled . cairrors re.aching from plviith to cot nice. fitted with l drawers, i cupboa,ds. and hanging compArtroents ; magnificent pedes- tal dressing table, fitted with eight drawers in the pedestals and large beveth d class attached supported by carved brac- kets; largo size pedestal washstand fitted with cupboards in ---u,.....,,,,. .tak • bedside redestal with napkin drawer, t iwel rail, -"' uaree charming uphe'stered chairs. The suite is guaranteed' solid throughout. Well worth £5O; packed, war- ranted, and delivered for 24 guineas. No extra charge for credit, five per cent, allowed tor prompt cash. Gershon, Universa' Furnishing Contractor. 44, Oldham-street, next to kdelphi Bank, Manchester. 411RISHON ALLOWS FIVE PER CENT DISCOUNT FOR PROMP , CASH. -- NUMBER of Bedroom Suites, just like new, 4, ro f m a hotel, in solid American Walnut, Bur Walnut, lit• 4 141 Walnut, Olive Wood, Bird's bye Maple. English Ash, si,cutogany. Cyprus, and ther woods. Each suite includes a d:Perior wardrobe well-fitted anti plate-glass door, bevelled; ;easing table with bevelled glass attached, some enclosed, s°,ale ow. and some with side reflectors ; double washstand titli marble slab tile back, anti bevelled shaving mirror ; ,edside cupbo.rd, chairs, and owe? airer ; the prices are 18, ....'B, 14. 12.10 and 8 guine s the -tuite. packed and deliver,ed. Attach suite is worth double. Five percent. for prompt cash. Ito extra for credit Call and inspe2t them. GERSHON, ttniversal Furnishing Contractor, 44, Oldham-stteet, next to - the Adelphi Bank, Manchester. --- GRAND BARGAIN IN DINING-ROOM SUITE. All the wo d work is guaranteed solid, spring stuffed, covered in dark grain leather, all in perfect trder ; the covering is new; proe, packed and delivered, e 4 18s fid. Charmit“ Suite, in saddle bags, all new cover- i,,4l4, extra stroni iolid frames 